[31m-## Sentiment ablation[m
[31m-[m
[31m-To determine whether FinBERT adds value, compare:[m
[31m-[m
[31m-1. MPT only[m
[31m-2. MPT plus raw FinBERT score[m
[31m-3. MPT plus confidence-weighted sentiment[m
[31m-4. MPT plus recency/source-weighted sentiment[m
[31m-5. equal weight[m
[31m-[m
[31m-Keep all other assumptions identical. Report performance by market regime and include uncertainty intervals. A higher in-sample Sharpe ratio alone is not enough evidence.[m
