[31m-## Sensitivity analysis[m
[31m-[m
[31m-Test the system across:[m
[31m-[m
[31m-- multiple lookback windows[m
[31m-- weekly, monthly, and quarterly rebalancing[m
[31m-- different risk-free rates[m
[31m-- alternative concentration caps[m
[31m-- different transaction costs[m
[31m-- multiple sentiment blend values[m
[31m-- covariance shrinkage versus sample covariance[m
[31m-- calm, crisis, rising-rate, and recovery periods[m
[31m-[m
[31m-Avoid selecting a single parameter because it performed best on the full evaluation period. Choose parameters using a training/validation process and report untouched test results.[m
